Description: Native PTY terminal for jailbroken iPhone (RootHide/Sileo).
 Real shell sessions (bash/zsh) on a PTY with a VT100/xterm-style emulator,
 plus a one-shot Linux environment bootstrap: Node.js via nvm, git, python3
 and AI CLIs, without repairing APT repositories.